Package: LDcorSV
Type: Package
Title: Linkage Disequilibrium Corrected by the Structure and the
        Relatedness
Version: 1.3.4
Imports: parallel
Authors@R: c(person(given = "David", family = "Desrousseaux", role = "aut"),
               person(given = "Florian", family = "Sandron", role = "aut"),
               person(given = "Aurélie", family = "Siberchicot", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aurelie.siberchicot@univ-lyon1.fr", comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7638-8318")),
               person(given = "Christine", family = "Cierco-Ayrolles", role = "aut"),
               person(given = "Brigitte", family = "Mangin", role = "aut"))
Description: Four measures of linkage disequilibrium are provided: the usual r^2
        measure, the r^2_S measure (r^2 corrected by the structure
        sample), the r^2_V (r^2 corrected by the relatedness of
        genotyped individuals), the r^2_VS measure (r^2 corrected by
        both the relatedness of genotyped individuals and the structure
        of the sample).
